n":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","r":[0.2065,0.6844,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/travelerdendro/261111-225304/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Exaiphanes Blade","text":"Restores 3 Energy every 5s and boosts CRIT Rate, helping Dendro Traveler maintain Burst uptime"},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"Generates white particles on crit, helping the whole team fund their Burst costs and improving…"},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"A chance to reset Skill cooldown allows more reaction triggers and faster energy recharge. Used by 8%…"},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"Boosts all party members' ATK and normal/charged/plunging damage after triggering reactions."},{"name":"Sapwood Blade","text":"Craftable option that provides Energy Recharge and creates a Leaf of Consciousness."}],"a":[{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"Shreds Dendro RES for team damage.","stats":"ER · Dendro/EM · CRIT"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst boosts party ATK by 20%.","stats":"ER · Dendro · CRIT"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Cheap team EM buff after reactions.","stats":"ER · EM · CRIT Rate"}],"t":[{"name":"Seeds of Thunder","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Kuki Shinobu","Xingqiu","Yaoyao"],"text":"Traveler and Yaoyao maintain Dendro, Xingqiu creates cores, and full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom. Let Hydro touch the Lamp before any Pyro.","roles":["Support / Sub DPS","Hyperbloom","Off-field","Support"]},{"name":"Quickened Circuit","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Keqing","Fischl","Zhongli"],"text":"Traveler maintains Quicken for Keqing and Fischl's Aggravate hits; Zhongli protects and reduces enemy RES. Electro transfiguration is useful.","roles":["Dendro Enabler / Battery","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Shielder / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Lotus Bloom","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Nilou","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Collei"],"text":"Nilou converts Bloom cores into Bountiful Cores; Kokomi heals and applies Hydro while Traveler and Collei supply Dendro. Hydro-expand the Lamp.","roles":["Dendro Enabler / Battery","Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Hydro Enabler","Dendro Enabler"]},{"name":"Controlled Burgeon","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Thoma","Xingqiu","Sangonomiya Kokomi"],"text":"Apply Hydro to Traveler's Lamp before Thoma's Pyro; Xingqiu and Kokomi generate cores. Build Thoma with EM and enough ER.","roles":["Dendro Enabler / Battery","Burgeon Trigger / Shielder","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Hydro Enabler"]}],"v":"Solo Dendro Battery: Prioritize roughly 200-250% ER with two Skill uses per rotation; Favonius or Sacrificial lowers demands.\nDouble Dendro: An allied Dendro battery can reduce ER toward 160-200%, letting you invest more in damage or EM.\nNilou Bloom: ER first; then add EM. Hydro-expand the Lamp and account for mixed Bloom ownership.\nBurgeon Safety: Transfigure the Lamp with Hydro before Pyro hits; otherwise Pyro detonates and removes it.\nTeam Buffer: If another ally uses Deepwood, choose Noblesse or Instructor for extra team buffs.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Dendro Traveler supplies off-field Dendro through their Burst's Lea Lotus Lamp. Prioritize Energy Recharge to sustain it. Hydro expands the Lamp's range, Electro speeds its hits, and Pyro destroys it, so plan reaction order carefully.","pros":["Reliable off-field Dendro","Free constellations","Strong Deepwood carrier","Fits many reaction teams"],"cons":["High Energy requirements","Burst can explode to Pyro","Fixed Burst area","Limited personal damage"],"weapons":["Exaiphanes Blade","Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Skyward Blade","Freedom-Sworn","Xiphos' Moonlight","Sapwood Blade","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge","Dendro DMG Bonus / EM","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["Solo ER: 200-250%","2 Dendro: 160-200%","Bloom ER: 200-250%","Fav CR: 40-60%"],"vars":[{"title":"Noblesse Team Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Sapwood Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Keep ER high; CRIT Rate helps Favonius. Personal damage is secondary.","teams":"Another ally must carry Deepwood for Dendro RES shred when needed.","when":"Use for Quicken or other teams where an existing Deepwood holder covers resistance reduction. Maintain Burst uptime for the party ATK buff.","cond":"Do not duplicate Noblesse on another teammate.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Nilou Bountiful Bloom","role":"Bloom Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Xiphos' Moonlight"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER first, then EM; EM goblet/circlet are viable if Traveler owns some Blooms.","teams":"Nilou plus only Hydro/Dendro allies; include a strong healer and ideally a second Dendro.","when":"Use Traveler to sustain Dendro and expand the Lamp with Hydro for coverage. Bloom ownership is mixed; Traveler EM only affects cores they create.","cond":"Nilou passive requires Hydro/Dendro-only party.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Quicken Personal Damage","role":"Off-field Sub DPS","weapons":["Freedom-Sworn","Favonius Sword","Skyward Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"After ER requirements, use Dendro goblet and CRIT circlet; EM and ATK% are useful.","teams":"Needs sustained Electro for Quicken; have another Deepwood holder if using Noblesse.","when":"With reliable Burst uptime, Traveler can add Spread damage alongside Dendro application. Electro transfiguration may help single-target hits.","cond":"ER requirement takes precedence over damage stats.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Budget Dendro Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Sapwood Blade","Skyrider Sword","Fleuve Cendre Ferryman"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Stack ER first. CRIT Rate matters with Favonius if you obtain it later.","teams":"Any Dendro reaction team; another Dendro unit makes Energy easier.","when":"An accessible setup for early-to-midgame teams. Sapwood offers craftable ER and an EM leaf; Instructor is a low-rarity team buff alternative.","cond":"Instructor is a 4-star artifact set.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Burgeon: Hydro-First Lamp","role":"Dendro Enabler","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Sapwood Blade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Deepwood Memories"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"High ER for reliable Lamp uptime; personal EM is not Burgeon trigger EM.","teams":"Need consistent Hydro, a Pyro core trigger built for EM, and sustain.","when":"Use Traveler Burst, immediately contact the Lamp with Hydro, then activate off-field Pyro. A Pyro-transfigured Lamp explodes and stops applying Dendro.","cond":"Requires safe rotation order. Avoid early Pyro near Lamp.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Brilliant Diamond Sliver","Brilliant Diamond Fragment","Brilliant Diamond Chunk","Brilliant Diamond Gemstone","","Teachings of Admonition","Guide to Admonition","Philosophies of Ingenuity","Fungal Spores","Luminescent Pollen","Luminescent Pollen","Windwheel Aster","Mudra of the Malefic General","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Not Priority"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Lvl 6 - 8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Lvl 8 - 9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Seeds of Thunder","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Kuki Shinobu","Xingqiu","Yaoyao"]},{"name":"Quickened Circuit","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Keqing","Fischl","Zhongli"]},{"name":"Lotus Bloom","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Nilou","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Collei"]},{"name":"Controlled Burgeon","members":["Traveler (Dendro)","Thoma","Xingqiu","Sangonomiya Kokomi"]}]}}],"title":"Traveler (Dendro)","el":"Dendro"}